 to control her  quirk rewind ever since the overhaul arc  and for the past two months in  particular arie has been practicing by  using her mind on lizards and insects  and she has been doing all this in an  attempt to learn to control  and harness her quirk so for example we  see that arie was practicing with a  lizard who had lost  its tail presumably she was able to  rewind  the lizard back to a state where he  still had a tail  even though the missing tail was never  actually reattached  which in itself is freaking crazy when  you think about it  meteo had actually learned in advance  about the big hero raids that would be  taking place in jakku hospital  and the villain mansion so he went to  arie and asked her to please  test out her abilities on him just in  time to actually join  the raid meteo felt bad about asking  arie to do this  he didn't want her to think that he was  just using her for her quirk  but arie was totally cool with it and  she agrees to help medio in the most  adorable way possible in fact arie has  been training  for this very purpose the entire time  she has always wanted to restore myrio's  quirk  after bullets made from her own body had  erased it  and of course miriah lost his quirk  while defending  airy as we can see the risk mirio took  paid off in a big way because  arie was indeed able to restore his  quirk permeation  and make no mistake this was a huge  risk if arie had made one wrong move  she could have killed mirio in an  instant by erasing him out of  existence just like she accidentally did  with her own  father practicing on lizards is one  thing but there is still a lot that  could have gone wrong  with this process and yet meteo chose to  take the risk  he literally risked his life because he  wanted to get his quirk back but not for  some personal reason  he wanted to get his quirk back so that  he can help his fellow heroes  fight against the villains meteo is a  true chad and an amazing hero  and that is why he is probably my  favorite character in the entire series  now as far as we can tell at this time  there have been no negative  repercussions for meteo  after aery used rewind on him although  we shouldn't  rush to judgement rewind is an extremely  overpowered  and unpredictable quirk and its effects  can have  unintended consequences even if we can't  see those consequences right away  aries newfound ability to control her  quirk is actually a huge  deal but the extent to which she can  actually control it  is still a mystery does she already have  perfect control  or could she still make a mistake that  has disastrous consequences  honestly only time will tell at any rate  as meteo continues to fight the nomu so  that best genius can focus on  restraining machia  bakugo returns to the fight in full  force  he uses his explosions to blast the crap  out of the nomu  and in the very next panel which is an  extremely beautiful and action-packed  panel by the way  we learned that nejire is also okay  she does appear to have some serious  burn marks though but she is still on  her feet  and fighting and she is happy to see  that meteo is back in  action and of course we are all happy to  see that nejire  is okay bakugo then proceeds to reveal  his new  official hero name to his mentor best  genius personally i was a huge fan of  king explosion murder  also known as lord explosion murder and  i will continue to stand  that name no matter what happens however  bakugo's new official hero name  is god of destruction dynamite dynamite  is spelled as d-y-n-a-m-i-g-h-t  so the name is a reference to both  dynamite which is an explosive  and to all might who is one of bakugo's  biggest role models  and that's really cool and clever and  all but let's be honest we're all just  gonna keep calling him either bakugou or  kachan no one is gonna be like oh hey  look it's our boy god of destruction  dynamite  no we're gonna be like hey it's bakugo  now meteo  actually likes bakugo's new name because  it's funny but bakugo is like  dude it's not supposed to be funny  bakugo is not exactly known for his  sense of humor  but meteo explains that laughter and joy  are an essential component of being  a hero so there's nothing wrong with  having a funny hero name  and yes my boy medio is right and that  is exactly why  bakugou should have just stuck with king  explosion murder  but whatever moving on as all of this is  happening in  one section of the battlefield dobby and  shoto are still  fighting not too far away an endeavor is  still just kind of watching it all with  a look of shock  and despair at the moment endeavor seems  to be unable to do anything other than  stare helplessly as two of his sons are  fighting a bitter battle to the death  during the battle shoto actually warns  dobby that he is  overusing his quirk and that his entire  body will burn up  but dobby doesn't care dobby loves the  look of despair  on endeavour's face and he is determined  to kill  shoto right in front of endeavour  because he really wants to see  endeavour's face  after his greatest toy shoto is  destroyed by his  own flames i talked about this before  but  dobby is truly obsessed with his desire  to get revenge on endeavor  and i mean obsessed in a mentally  disturbed way that obstructs  all reason and logic i mean dobby  clearly knows that shoto  is not responsible for what endeavor has  done and dobby also knows that shoto is  his own brother  and yet dabi wants to make endeavour  suffer so badly that he is willing to  kill his own brother  his own brother who is innocent just to  make endeavors suffer that  is really messed up and as i said before  it is also hypocritical  the whole reason why endeavour became  abusive to his family and to dobby in  particular  was his own obsession with surpassing  all might  endeavour's obsession destroyed his  family and tore it apart  and now dobby's obsession with revenge  is doing the exact same thing  it is a truly sad and i